                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1090/pspum/083"} doi:10.1090/pspum/083
            %h4#InterpretationInTMFCohomology Conjectural interpretation in tmf-cohomology
            %p
              The resulting suggestion that, roughly, deformation-classes (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/concordance"} concordance
              classes) of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2d+SCFTs"} 2d SCFTs
              with
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/target+space"} target space
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
              are the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Whitehead-generalized+cohomology"} generalized cohomology
              of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
              with
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coefficients"} coefficients
              in the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spectrum"} spectrum
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+modular+forms"} topological modular forms
              (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tmf"}> tmf
              ):
            %ul
              %li#StolzTeichner11
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stephan+Stolz"}> Stephan Stolz
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Peter+Teichner"} Peter Teichner
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Supersymmetric field theories and generalized cohomology
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hisham+Sati"} Hisham Sati
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
                (eds.),
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a{:href => "http://ncatlab.org/schreiber/show/Mathematical+Foundations+of+Quantum+Field+and+Perturbative+String+Theory#ContributionStolzTeichner"} Mathematical foundations of Quantum field theory and String theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1108.0189"} arXiv:1108.0189
            %p
              and the more explicit suggestion that, under this identification, the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chern-Dold+character"} Chern-Dold character
              from
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/tmf"} tmf
              to
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modular+forms"} modular forms
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2d+SCFT"} 2d SCFT
              to its
              = succeed "/" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/partition+function"} partition function
              = succeed "/supersymmetric" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elliptic+genus"} elliptic genus
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Davide+Gaiotto"}> Davide Gaiotto
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Theo+Johnson-Freyd"} Theo Johnson-Freyd
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Holomorphic SCFTs with small index
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.00589"} arXiv:1811.00589
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.4153/S0008414X2100002X"} doi:10.4153/S0008414X2100002X
            %p
              This perspective is also picked up in
              = succeed "." do
                %a{:href => "#GukovPeiPutrovVafa18"} Gukov, Pei, Putrov &amp; Vafa 18
            %p
              Discussion of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2d+SCFTs"} 2d SCFTs
              (namely
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/supersymmetry"} supersymmetric
              = succeed "-" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SU%282%29"} SU(2)
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/WZW-models"} WZW-models
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ℤ
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                    %mn 24
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbb{Z}/24
              %a{:href => "tmf#BoardmanHomomorphismInTmfIs6Connected"}
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo ≃
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \simeq
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi tmf
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                        %mn 3
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mo *
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo =
                    %msub
                      %mi π
                      %mn 3
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi tmf
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                    tmf^{-3}(\ast)
                    \=
                    \\pi_3(tmf)
              %a{:href => "tmf#BoardmanHomomorphismInTmfIs6Connected"}
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mo ≃
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \simeq
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi π
                      %mn 3
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi 𝕊
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \pi_3(\mathbb{S})
              (the
              = succeed "):" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/third+stable+homotopy+group+of+spheres"} third stable homotopy group of spheres
            %ul
              %li#GaiottoJohnsonFreydWitten19
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Davide+Gaiotto"}> Davide Gaiotto
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Theo+Johnson-Freyd"} Theo Johnson-Freyd
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"} Edward Witten
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em A Note On Some Minimally Supersymmetric Models In Two Dimensions
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1902.10249"} arXiv:1902.10249
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Integrability, Quantization, and Geometry: II. Quantum Theories and Algebraic Geometry
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://bookstore.ams.org/pspum-103-2"} ISBN: 978-1-4704-5592-7
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Davide+Gaiotto"}> Davide Gaiotto
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Theo+Johnson-Freyd"} Theo Johnson-Freyd
                  %em Mock modularity and a secondary elliptic genus
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1904.05788"}> arXiv:1904.05788
                  )
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Theo+Johnson-Freyd"}> Theo Johnson-Freyd
                  ,
                  %em Topological Mathieu Moonshine
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.02922"}> arXiv:2006.02922
                  )
            %p See also
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  Ying-Hsuan Lin,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Du+Pei"} Du Pei
                  %em Holomorphic CFTs and topological modular forms
                  \&amp;lbrack;
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2112.10724"}> arXiv:2112.10724
                  \&amp;rbrack;
              %li
                %p
                  Jan Albert, Justin Kaidi, Ying-Hsuan Lin,
                  %em Topological modularity of Supermoonshine
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.14923"} arXiv:2210.14923
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} ]
            %h4#occurrences_in_string_theory Occurrences in string theory
            %h5#ReferencesEllipticGeneraAsPartitionFunctionsOfHStrings H-string elliptic genus
            %p
              Further on the elliptic genus of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/heterotic+string"} heterotic string
              being the
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Witten+genus"} Witten genus
            %p
              The interpretation of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/equivariant+elliptic+genera"} equivariant elliptic genera
              as
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/partition+functions"} partition functions
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/parametrized+WZW+models"} parametrized WZW models
              in
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/heterotic+string+theory"} heterotic string theory
            %ul
              %li#DistlerSharpe07
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacques+Distler"}> Jacques Distler
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eric+Sharpe"} Eric Sharpe
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Heterotic compactifications with principal bundles for general groups and general levels
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0701244"} arXiv:hep-th/0701244
              %li#Ando07
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Matthew+Ando"}> Matthew Ando
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Equivariant elliptic cohomology and the Fibered WZW models of Distler and Sharpe
                  %a{:href => "http://www.math.ucsb.edu/~drm/GTPseminar/2007-fall.php"} talk 2007
                  (
                  %a{:href => "http://www.math.ucsb.edu/~drm/GTPseminar/notes/20071026-ando/20071026-malmendier.pdf"}> lecture notes pdf
                  )
            %p
              Speculations on physics aspects of lifting the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Witten+genus"} Witten genus
              to
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+modular+forms"} topological modular forms
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yuji+Tachikawa"}> Yuji Tachikawa
                  ,
                  %em Topological modular forms and the absence of a heterotic global anomaly
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2103.12211"}> arXiv:2103.12211
                  )
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yuji+Tachikawa"}> Yuji Tachikawa
                  , Mayuko Yamashita,
                  %em Topological modular forms and the absence of all heterotic global anomalies
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2108.13542"}> arXiv:2108.13542
                  )
            %h5#ReferencesEllipticGeneraAsPartitionFunctionsOfM5Branes M5-brane elliptic genus
            %p
              On the
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane+elliptic+genus"} M5-brane elliptic genus
            %p
              A
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2d+SCFT"} 2d SCFT
              argued to describe the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/KK-compactification"} KK-compactification
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-brane"} M5-brane
              on a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/4-manifold"} 4-manifold
              (specifically: a
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/complex+surface"} complex surface
            %ul
              %li
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Juan+Maldacena"}> Juan Maldacena
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrew+Strominger"} Andrew Strominger
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Edward+Witten"} Edward Witten
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Black Hole Entropy in M-Theory
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9711053"} arXiv:hep-th/9711053
            %p
              Discussion of the resulting
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elliptic+genus"} elliptic genus
              (
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/2d+SCFT"} 2d SCFT
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/partition+function"} partition function
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Davide+Gaiotto"}> Davide Gaiotto
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Andrew+Strominger"} Andrew Strominger
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xi+Yin"} Xi Yin
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em The M5-Brane Elliptic Genus: Modularity and BPS States
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0607010"} hep-th/0607010
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Davide+Gaiotto"}> Davide Gaiotto
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Xi+Yin"} Xi Yin
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em Examples of M5-Brane Elliptic Genera
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0702012"} arXiv:hep-th/0702012
            %p Further discussion in:
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  Murad Alim, Babak Haghighat, Michael Hecht,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Albrecht+Klemm"} Albrecht Klemm
                  %em Wall-crossing holomorphic anomaly and mock modularity of multiple M5-branes
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1012.1608"}> arXiv:1012.1608
                  )
              %li#GukovPeiPutrovVafa18
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Sergei+Gukov"}> Sergei Gukov
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Du+Pei"} Du Pei
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pavel+Putrov"} Pavel Putrov
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"} Cumrun Vafa
                  %em 4-manifolds and topological modular forms
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1811.07884"}> arXiv:1811.07884
                  ,
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://inspirehep.net/literature/1704312"} spire:1704312
            %h5#ReferencesEllipticGeneraAsPartitionFunctionsOfMStrings M-string elliptic genus
            %p
              On the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elliptic+genus"} elliptic genus
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M-strings"} M-strings
              inside
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-branes"} M5-branes
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefan+Hohenegger"}> Stefan Hohenegger
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Amer+Iqbal"} Amer Iqbal
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em
                      M-strings, Elliptic Genera and
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %mi 𝒩
                            %mo =
                            %mn 4
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{N}=4
                      String Amplitudes
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1310.1325"} arXiv:1310.1325
              %li
                %p
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Stefan+Hohenegger"}> Stefan Hohenegger
                  ,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Amer+Iqbal"} Amer Iqbal
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em M String, Monopole String and Modular Forms
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1503.06983"} arXiv:1503.06983
              %li
                %p
                  M. Nouman Muteeb,
                  %em Domain walls and M2-branes partition functions: M-theory and ABJM Theory
                  (
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.04233"}> arXiv:2010.04233
                  )
            %h5#ReferencesEllipticGeneraAsPartitionFunctionsOfEStrings E-string elliptic genus
            %p
              On the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elliptic+genus"} elliptic genus
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/E-strings"} E-strings
              as
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/wrapped+brane"} wrapped
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-branes"} M5-branes
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  J. A. Minahan, D. Nemeschansky,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"} Cumrun Vafa
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em
                      E-Strings and
                      %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                        %semantics
                          %mrow
                            %mi N
                            %mo =
                            %mn 4
                          %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} N=4
                      Topological Yang-Mills Theories
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/9802168"} arXiv:hep-th/9802168
              %li
                %p
                  Wenhe Cai, Min-xin Huang, Kaiwen Sun,
                  = succeed "," do
                    %em On the Elliptic Genus of Three E-strings and Heterotic Strings
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1411.2801"} arXiv:1411.2801
                  = succeed ")" do
                    %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/JHEP01(2015)079"} doi:10.1007/JHEP01(2015)079
            %p
              On the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/elliptic+genus"} elliptic genus
              of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/E-strings"} E-strings
              as
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M2-branes"} M2-branes
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/brane+intersection"} ending on
              = succeed ":" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/M5-branes"} M5-branes
            %ul
              %li#KKLPV14
                Joonho Kim, Seok Kim, Kimyeong Lee,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jaemo+Park"} Jaemo Park
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cumrun+Vafa"} Cumrun Vafa
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Elliptic Genus of E-strings
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1411.2324"} arXiv:1411.2324
